oactivator of B-cell-specific transcription. Plays a role in spermiogenesis and oogenesis."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}